<li><strong>Create Auth Handlers:</strong> Adds a catch-all route at <code>app/handler/[...stack]/page.tsx</code>. This single file handles all authentication UI flows (sign-up, sign-in, password reset, OAuth callbacks) provided by Neon Auth.</li>
